 next is thinking about other content  that you can create on your own site and  through your own social media channels  and quite often this comes just from  questions so you may not have readership  yet you may not have a lot of people who  are on your website yet or following you  on Twitter on Facebook but you're  meeting people you're meeting prospects  you're meeting potential clients you  know meeting with clients and what you  can do is turn those questions into  posts and instead of being promotional  you want to think about how can you add  value if you add a lot of value people  will follow you  they'll spend more time on your website  and the next time they're looking at  barring life insurance guess who they're  going to want to call first you because  they like you to know you they trust you  they enjoy your story they think you're  an honest guy and they're going to want  to work with you so it's creating that  value add content so if you get  questions from people if you're meeting  with prospects you're an expert right  you know what you're doing this goes for  all entrepreneurs hopefully you're an  expert in what you do and you can answer  these questions inside out any day of  the week  for your prospects or customers it's  confusing it's scary they've never done  this before they have a lot of questions  and so if you can answer those questions  for them in a really friendly helpful  way then they're going to build a  relationship with you and want to sign  up for your services so when people are  asking you questions turn those into  potential blog posts turn those into  tweets turn those into Facebook posts  you might if you're you know adventurous  turn it into a video post like I did  with these ones here so just as a quick  example I used to get a whole bunch of  emails from people asking them to help  them with their business and I love  doing it that's what I do most of the  time I'm not going to pay for it I just  love helping entrepreneurs and seeing  them have some success I know hard it is  to try to start up a business and feel  like you're all alone doing it so if I  can help I try I used to answer those  emails just with an email reply and it  really helped that person always said  great thank you so much but then I  realized you know I'm only helping that  one person and chances are lots of other  people have the same problem in the same  question so I started making these  youtube videos as a way to answer that  person's question but also help a lot  more people so you know you're asking  how can I promote your your life  insurance business online but the same  advice can be used for anybody who's  trying to promote online so hopefully  I'm answering your question but also  everybody else who has the same question  Suki's do the same thing doesn't  necessarily have to be a video you can  work your way up to that I know it can  be scary and frustrating and doesn't  have to be too expensive but it's new  and time-consuming so you have to be  committed to it but it is a great way to  build up a connection with people they  can see your face and hopefully a big  smile and it builds that relationship  but start slow start at the beginning  start by making those partnerships with  other bloggers offering to create guest  content for them to start building up a  presence then have your own website that  tells your story is personal is  emotional explains why you believe  passionately in what you're doing and  then start creating your own content by  answering questions from your readers  and from your prospects and your clients  and sharing that with people so that you  become known as the expert to go to when  people have questions about life  insurance online so hopefully that helps  for those of you watching if you like  the video please give it a thumbs up  below it makes you want to do more these  for you and you have a question or  comment I love to hear we have to say if  you want to leave i